lass=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-300503 nkbd.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c1/Spine_static-300503_nkbd.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"176\" height=\"570\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"176\" data-file-height=\"570\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3005\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B%C2%B7%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF\" title=\"尼克·波顿\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B%C2%B7%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF\" title=\"尼克·波顿\"><img alt=\"尼克·波顿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-300501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-300501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/55/HeadIconSmall-300501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%BC%E5%85%8B%C2%B7%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF\" title=\"尼克·波顿\">尼克·波顿</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>色彩的知觉</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：300503</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">在结束了纺织厂的工作之后，他来到了美术馆。<br />相较于美术馆的门票，他那份薪水实在微薄得可怜。即使如此，他依然每日前来。尽管他的廉价西装的肘部已磨得发亮，但那至少是一套西装，已是一位纺织工人竭尽所能的体面。<br />光有服装还不够，他还带了一支玫瑰。玫瑰的材质源自于几种廉价的丝绸，他捡拾那些被废弃的边角料，细心地缝好，直到它和真正的玫瑰别无二致。<br />只有这样，才衬得上那位画框中的女郎。<br />他如此静立着，直到自己也成为了一尊雕像。在渐暗的光线里，他、他的玫瑰、他框住的记忆，终于与墙上那个百年前的梦融为一体。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"300503\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/33/Belonging-300504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“永不凋零”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Ever-Blooming\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.1<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一支不会凋谢的花儿，由铁丝、碎布与线拼凑而成。<br />它如此廉价，如此拙劣，如此无足轻重；却又如此珍贵，如此赤诚，如此恒久留存。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e3/Belonging-300505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">缝纫工具收纳臂袋<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sewing Kit</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />39<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>被精心保养的工具套装，但长期的使用依然为它留下了不少磨损。<br />“咱能用它补衣服，也能用它缝戏台的布景。有时候，咱也用它织出一场梦。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f9/Belonging-300506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">模糊的肖像<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">A Blurry Portrait</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一幅绘有白衣女郎的画像，女人的面容与穿着均十分模糊。<br />她是幻想，抑或真实？受访者是在回避这面容，还是殷切等待着画中人前来相认？<br />在受访者的沉默中，答案不得而知。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 “波顿的梦”1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 “波顿的梦”2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E2%80%9C%E6%B3%A2%E9%A1%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%A2%A6%E2%80%9D2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">“波顿的梦” <small style=\"color: grey\">\"Bottom's Dream\"</small></span></span>"}}